# Normalise text to LF in the repository, whatever the checkout platform does.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary. resume.pdf is mostly ASCII, so Git guesses "text" and would rewrite
# its line endings — which shifts every byte offset in the xref table and
# leaves an unopenable file.
*.pdf   binary
*.webp  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.woff2 binary